ogireta Film), 18 (in encore)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Fighting games and hot Nata de coco juice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A third-year student at Ayazono high school, and Haruto's kouhai. Asuka is the younger sister of Yuusuke, who was a friend of Haruto's and died a year ago. She has a part-time job at a fast food restaurant. She is a close friend of Miumi, as well as her classmate."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka is a bright, friendly and brave girl who sometimes reminds of a little devil. Her lack of sense of direction is catastrophic, she is almost like a deadly machine with no common sense. But once you get used to know her, it's not that critical... Or is it?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was a child actress on TV or doramas but she's no longer in that business."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c11715"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b365b5d7e8bd32c664c1b6d41a88ab8d478d6f2d4bda0b9093bddfbe7a5e4cd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/492950c4e16218debe0eddcfb46ab1f99072828edd1d9ff043d198f876b09106.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野川 さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s1611","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1611","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1611","name":"野川 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:11917","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c11808","characterName":"観島 香月","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c11808"},"originalCharacterName":"観島 香月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"19"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1129"},"bl